# {{APP_NAME}} (saas)

SaaS application foundation. This starter wires the integrations it actually
installs and states clearly what is NOT configured.

Included:

- A real, process-local in-memory job queue example in src/lib/server/jobs.ts.
- A GET /health endpoint.
- Standard Schema validation package.

NOT included and NOT implied:

- Authentication, user accounts, roles, sessions, or any login flow.
- Durable database persistence.
- Billing, subscriptions, or payments of any kind.
- Any external provider adapter.

The in-memory queue is process-local and not durable. Do not deploy multiple
instances against it. Add auth/database/cache/session integrations explicitly
when you are ready to configure them.

